# 6) Workflow state machine (consent/notice lifecycle)

## Consent transitions (enforced)
- `REQUIRED → REQUESTED → RECEIVED`
- `REQUIRED/REQUESTED → WAIVED` (requires role)

```java
public void markConsentReceived(UUID consentId, UserContext ctx) {
  ctx.require("CONSENT_ADMIN");
  ConsentRequirementEntity c = repo.findById(consentId).orElseThrow();
  if (!List.of("REQUIRED","REQUESTED").contains(c.status)) throw new IllegalStateException();
  c.status = "RECEIVED";
  c.receivedAt = Instant.now();
  repo.save(c);
  audit.record("CONSENT_RECEIVED", ctx.userId(), c.tradeId, "{\"consentId\":\""+consentId+"\"}");
  events.publish(new DomainEvent("CONSENT_RECEIVED", c.tradeId));
}
```

## Notice transitions
- `REQUIRED → SENT → VERIFIED`
- proofRef required for SENT/VERIFIED

