@Component
public class EsgClauseExtractionAi {

  private final OpenAiClient openAi;
  private final JsonSchemaValidator validator;

  public DraftEsgConfig extractDraft(String clauseText) {

    String prompt = """
    Extract ESG obligations ONLY as JSON:
    - obligationCode
    - metricCode
    - baseline
    - target
    - targetDate
    - incentiveBps
    - clauseRef
    Do NOT interpret or decide compliance.
    """;

    String rawJson = openAi.call(prompt + clauseText);

    validator.validate(rawJson, "esg-draft.schema.json");

    return parse(rawJson);
  }
}
```

### Output status
- **DRAFT**
- Must be approved by **ESG_ADMIN**
- Only approved config becomes executable

✅ **AI footprint = ~3–5% of system**  
❌ **AI never runs in runtime decisions**

