## 4.5 Deterministic Target Evaluation (R-ESG-05)

```java
@Service
public class EsgEvaluationService {

  public EsgEvaluation evaluate(EsgTarget t, EsgSubmission s) {

    boolean met =
      t.getComparator().equals("<=")
        ? s.getReportedValue().compareTo(t.getTargetValue()) <= 0
        : s.getReportedValue().compareTo(t.getTargetValue()) >= 0;

    return evaluationRepo.save(
      new EsgEvaluation(
        t.getTargetId(),
        s.getSubmissionId(),
        met ? "MET" : "FAILED",
        Instant.now()
      )
    );
  }
}
```

