## 7. THRESHOLD EVALUATION ENGINE (DETERMINISTIC CORE)

```java
public class EsgThresholdEngine {

  public EvaluationResult evaluate(
      EsgTarget target,
      BigDecimal actualValue
  ) {
    boolean met = switch (target.comparator) {
      case "<=" -> actualValue.compareTo(target.targetValue) <= 0;
      case ">=" -> actualValue.compareTo(target.targetValue) >= 0;
      default -> false;
    };

    return new EvaluationResult(
      met ? "MET" : "FAILED",
      actualValue,
      target.targetValue
    );
  }
}
```

No AI  
No probability  
No opinions  

