# D. BACKEND — REAL CODE (SPRING BOOT)

## 1️⃣ Controller

```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/loans")
public class LoanController {

    private final CanonService canonService;

    public LoanController(CanonService canonService) {
        this.canonService = canonService;
    }

    @PostMapping("/documents")
    public ResponseEntity<DocumentRef> upload(@RequestParam MultipartFile file) {
        return ResponseEntity.ok(canonService.ingest(file));
    }

    @PostMapping("/extract/{docId}")
    public CanonicalLoan extract(@PathVariable UUID docId) {
        return canonService.extractCanonical(docId);
    }

    @PostMapping("/approve/{docId}")
    public CanonicalLoan approve(@PathVariable UUID docId,
                                 @RequestBody ApprovalRequest req) {
        return canonService.approve(docId, req.user());
    }

    @GetMapping("/{loanId}/diff")
    public LoanDiff diff(@PathVariable UUID loanId,
                         @RequestParam int v1,
                         @RequestParam int v2) {
        return canonService.diff(loanId, v1, v2);
    }
}
```

