## 2️⃣ Service (Deterministic Core)

```java
@Service
public class CanonService {

    private final TikaParser tika;
    private final CanonRules rules;
    private final CanonRepository repo;
    private final AiExtractor ai;

    public CanonService(...) { ... }

    public DocumentRef ingest(MultipartFile file) {
        String text = tika.parse(file);
        return repo.saveRawDocument(text);
    }

    public CanonicalLoan extractCanonical(UUID docId) {
        String text = repo.loadRaw(docId);
        CanonicalLoan draft = ai.propose(text);
        rules.validate(draft);
        return draft;
    }

    public CanonicalLoan approve(UUID docId, String user) {
        CanonicalLoan loan = repo.loadDraft(docId);
        loan.audit().approve(user);
        return repo.versionedSave(loan);
    }

    public LoanDiff diff(UUID loanId, int v1, int v2) {
        return LoanDiff.compare(
            repo.loadVersion(loanId, v1),
            repo.loadVersion(loanId, v2)
        );
    }
}
```

AI is **boxed**. Rules decide validity.

