## 3️⃣ Rules Engine (NO AI HERE)

```java
@Component
public class CanonRules {

    public void validate(CanonicalLoan loan) {
        if (loan.getDates().getMaturityDate()
            .isBefore(loan.getDates().getEffectiveDate())) {
            throw new ValidationException("Maturity before effective date");
        }
        if (loan.getEconomics().getMargin() <= 0) {
            throw new ValidationException("Invalid margin");
        }
    }
}
```

